  ("How much does furnace humidifier installation cost in Ontario?", "Furnace humidifier installation cost depends on the type, with bypass units the least expensive, fan-powered in the middle and steam units the most. EHI quotes a guaranteed installed price after seeing your furnace room, and we can bundle it with a furnace or heat pump installation."),
  ("What humidity level should my house be in winter?", "Aim for 30 to 40% relative humidity in an Ontario winter. Lower the setting on very cold days, closer to 30% at -20°C, to avoid condensation on the windows, and run it up to 40% in milder weather."),
  ("Can a humidifier work with a heat pump air handler?", "Yes. Bypass and fan-powered humidifiers mount on a heat pump air handler the same way they do on a furnace, and a steam humidifier is often the best match because it does not depend on high supply-air temperatures to evaporate water."),
  ("How often should the humidifier pad be replaced?", "Replace the humidifier pad, also called the water panel, once a year at the start of the heating season. Homes with very hard well water may need a mid-winter change as well."),
